### NetBeans ###
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/
# NOTE: no bare `build/` ignore here, deliberately. `/build/` at the repo root is a SOURCE
# directory holding ludwig-bom, ludwig-service-parent, checkstyle-rules and architecture-rules.
# This is a Maven reactor - build output goes to target/, which is ignored above - so the
# NetBeans/Gradle `build/` pattern that used to sit here was vestigial as well as harmful.

### VS Code ###
.vscode/

### Mac OS ###
.DS_Store
### Maven ###
# Written by flatten-maven-plugin at process-resources and removed again by `mvn clean`.
# It is the POM that actually gets installed/deployed (with ${revision} resolved), a build
# output rather than a source file.
.flattened-pom.xml

### code-index MCP server
# Fallback location for the code index state, used only when $TMPDIR is unwritable.
# It is a rebuildable ~6.5MB SQLite cache, never a source file. See docs/code-index.md.
.code_indexer/

### Claude Code
# Personal overrides. The committed harness is .claude/settings.json.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Personal MCP server config for this checkout.
.claude.json
